# Code owners for this repository.
#
# GitHub requests a review from the owner of every path a pull request touches.
# The roster and what "sole maintainer" means in practice are in MAINTAINERS.md;
# the route to becoming an owner of an area is in GOVERNANCE.md.
#
# Ownership is total and deliberate: one maintainer owns every path, so the
# catch-all below is the whole policy. The per-area lines that follow it are not
# a second owner — they are the areas that would be split first if a second
# maintainer joined, and they keep this file honest about where the work is.
#
# Note: the email address below only routes a review request if it is a verified
# email on the owner's GitHub account. The handle is the reliable form; both are
# listed so the file stays useful outside GitHub too.

# Everything.
*                                       joel@joelparkerhenderson.com @joelparkerhenderson

# Specs — the source of truth. Changes here precede code changes.
/spec.md                                @joelparkerhenderson
/spec/                                  @joelparkerhenderson
/forms/*/spec/                          @joelparkerhenderson

# The toolchain: generators, refactors, drift detectors, test gates.
/bin/                                   @joelparkerhenderson

# SQL schemas — the source of truth for every data shape.
